# Generated by the FFmpeg build script / git clone - never commit it.
src/main/jni/ffmpeg/
# CMake / NDK output: the Gradle path uses .cxx, scripts/build-ffmpeg-decoder.sh uses
# build-ffmpeg-<abi>. The .so files are copied out of both into src/main/jniLibs/.
src/main/jni/.cxx/
src/main/jni/build-ffmpeg-*/
# The prebuilt decoder libraries themselves are tracked (that is the point of jniLibs), but a
# half-copied tree would silently ship a missing ABI, so list them explicitly.
!src/main/jniLibs/**
